    {
      "story_id": "US-001",
      "revision_id": "R1",
      "title": "Beacon v1.3.9 beacon-friction-intake and sqlite governance queue",
      "priority": "medium",
      "status": "accepted",
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "AC-001",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "naming",
          "text": "Beacon 对外存在统一的 `beacon-friction-intake` 能力定义，作为长期推荐入口。",
          "required": true,
          "status": "accepted",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "manual-v139-friction-intake-implement-20260428",
          "verified_by_run_id": "run-20260428T173908043826",
          "accepted_at": "2026-04-28T09:39:24.956923+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1",
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
          "source": "user-story:markdown"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-002",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "compatibility",
          "text": "旧的 `memory-friction-evolution` 可以作为兼容实现来源存在，但不再作为长期主语义。",
          "required": true,
          "status": "accepted",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "manual-v139-friction-intake-implement-20260428",
          "verified_by_run_id": "run-20260428T173908043826",
          "accepted_at": "2026-04-28T09:39:24.956923+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1",
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
          "source": "user-story:markdown"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-003",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "boundary",
          "text": "`beacon-friction-intake` 被定义为 support-surface 入口，而不是新的主 Beacon stage。",
          "required": true,
          "status": "accepted",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "manual-v139-friction-intake-implement-20260428",
          "verified_by_run_id": "run-20260428T173908043826",
          "accepted_at": "2026-04-28T09:39:24.956923+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1",
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
          "source": "user-story:markdown"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-101",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "scan-mode",
          "text": "在 Beacon 源码项目中可以执行 `scan` 模式，自动提取项目摩擦、阻塞、bug 或重复问题。",
          "required": true,
          "status": "accepted",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "manual-v139-friction-intake-implement-20260428",
          "verified_by_run_id": "run-20260428T173908043826",
          "accepted_at": "2026-04-28T09:39:24.956923+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1",
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
          "source": "user-story:markdown"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-102",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "evidence",
          "text": "`scan` 结果能够绑定项目内证据来源，如 `.beacon/debug/`、`.beacon/memory/`、`.beacon/analysis/` 或等价运行证据。",
          "required": true,
          "status": "accepted",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "manual-v139-friction-intake-implement-20260428",
          "verified_by_run_id": "run-20260428T173908043826",
          "accepted_at": "2026-04-28T09:39:24.956923+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1",
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
          "source": "user-story:markdown"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-103",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "classification",
          "text": "`scan` 结果会被标准化成统一 friction item，而不是只产出一次性的分析报告。",
          "required": true,
          "status": "accepted",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "manual-v139-friction-intake-implement-20260428",
          "verified_by_run_id": "run-20260428T173908043826",
          "accepted_at": "2026-04-28T09:39:24.956923+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1",
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
          "source": "user-story:markdown"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-201",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "capture-mode",
          "text": "在目标开发项目中可以执行 `capture` 模式，记录一次人工输入的上下文摩擦。",
          "required": true,
          "status": "accepted",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "manual-v139-friction-intake-implement-20260428",
          "verified_by_run_id": "run-20260428T173908043826",
          "accepted_at": "2026-04-28T09:39:24.956923+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1",
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
          "source": "user-story:markdown"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-202",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "llm-normalization",
          "text": "系统会对人工记录执行 summary 规范化、分类、严重级别判断、领域判断与证据引用绑定。",
          "required": true,
          "status": "accepted",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "manual-v139-friction-intake-implement-20260428",
          "verified_by_run_id": "run-20260428T173908043826",
          "accepted_at": "2026-04-28T09:39:24.956923+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1",
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
          "source": "user-story:markdown"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-203",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "source-type",
          "text": "人工记录项与自动扫描项会通过 `source_type` 或等价字段区分，但进入同一治理队列。",
          "required": true,
          "status": "accepted",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "manual-v139-friction-intake-implement-20260428",
          "verified_by_run_id": "run-20260428T173908043826",
          "accepted_at": "2026-04-28T09:39:24.956923+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1",
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
          "source": "user-story:markdown"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-301",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "dual-write",
          "text": "任一 `scan` 或 `capture` 完成后，项目内证据可保留，同时全局 sqlite 中出现对应 friction item。",
          "required": true,
          "status": "accepted",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "manual-v139-friction-intake-implement-20260428",
          "verified_by_run_id": "run-20260428T173908043826",
          "accepted_at": "2026-04-28T09:39:24.956923+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1",
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
          "source": "user-story:markdown"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-302",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "queue-state",
          "text": "friction item 至少具有可治理的状态流，如 `queued`、`claimed`、`resolved`、`reopened` 或等价状态。",
          "required": true,
          "status": "accepted",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "manual-v139-friction-intake-implement-20260428",
          "verified_by_run_id": "run-20260428T173908043826",
          "accepted_at": "2026-04-28T09:39:24.956923+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1",
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
          "source": "user-story:markdown"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-303",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "sqlite-recovery",
          "text": "当 sqlite 暂时不可用时，dual-write 失败会显式记录，且后续支持恢复与重放。",
          "required": true,
          "status": "accepted",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "manual-v139-friction-intake-implement-20260428",
          "verified_by_run_id": "run-20260428T173908043826",
          "accepted_at": "2026-04-28T09:39:24.956923+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1",
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
          "source": "user-story:markdown"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-401",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "item-class",
          "text": "每条 friction item 至少会落入 `blocking_bug`、`improvement`、`optimization_enhancement` 之一。",
          "required": true,
          "status": "accepted",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "manual-v139-friction-intake-implement-20260428",
          "verified_by_run_id": "run-20260428T173908043826",
          "accepted_at": "2026-04-28T09:39:24.956923+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1",
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
          "source": "user-story:markdown"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-402",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "governance-fields",
          "text": "每条 friction item 至少具备 summary、source_type、severity、domain、queue_status、project_root、evidence_refs、first_seen_at、last_seen_at 或等价字段。",
          "required": true,
          "status": "accepted",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "manual-v139-friction-intake-implement-20260428",
          "verified_by_run_id": "run-20260428T173908043826",
          "accepted_at": "2026-04-28T09:39:24.956923+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1",
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
          "source": "user-story:markdown"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-403",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "projection-boundary",
          "text": "`debug_issues` 保持 runtime projection 快照定位，不能直接替代治理队列。",
          "required": true,
          "status": "accepted",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "manual-v139-friction-intake-implement-20260428",
          "verified_by_run_id": "run-20260428T173908043826",
          "accepted_at": "2026-04-28T09:39:24.956923+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1",
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
          "source": "user-story:markdown"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-501",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "default-queue-only",
          "text": "新摩擦项默认只进入治理队列，不自动进入 `prd`、`user-story`、`test-case`、`implement`、`qa` 或 `release`。",
          "required": true,
          "status": "accepted",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "manual-v139-friction-intake-implement-20260428",
          "verified_by_run_id": "run-20260428T173908043826",
          "accepted_at": "2026-04-28T09:39:24.956923+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1",
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
          "source": "user-story:markdown"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-502",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "explicit-gate",
          "text": "只有进入 `accepted_for_requirement` 或等价显式接受状态后，摩擦项才允许路由到 `beacon-prd` 或 `beacon-change`。",
          "required": true,
          "status": "accepted",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "manual-v139-friction-intake-implement-20260428",
          "verified_by_run_id": "run-20260428T173908043826",
          "accepted_at": "2026-04-28T09:39:24.956923+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1",
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
          "source": "user-story:markdown"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-503",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "truth-protection",
          "text": "requirement truth 的更新仍由正式 requirement/change surface 负责，而非 intake 入口直接写入。",
          "required": true,
          "status": "accepted",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "manual-v139-friction-intake-implement-20260428",
          "verified_by_run_id": "run-20260428T173908043826",
          "accepted_at": "2026-04-28T09:39:24.956923+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1",
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
          "source": "user-story:markdown"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-601",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "local-truth",
          "text": "`.beacon/debug/`、`.beacon/memory/`、`.beacon/analysis/` 或等价项目内产物继续承担原始证据 truth。",
          "required": true,
          "status": "accepted",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "manual-v139-friction-intake-implement-20260428",
          "verified_by_run_id": "run-20260428T173908043826",
          "accepted_at": "2026-04-28T09:39:24.956923+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1",
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
          "source": "user-story:markdown"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-602",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "no-second-truth",
          "text": "全局 sqlite 只存治理必需的索引、分类、状态与引用，不存第二份完整正文 truth。",
          "required": true,
          "status": "accepted",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "manual-v139-friction-intake-implement-20260428",
          "verified_by_run_id": "run-20260428T173908043826",
          "accepted_at": "2026-04-28T09:39:24.956923+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1",
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
          "source": "user-story:markdown"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-603",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "replay",
          "text": "当全局 sqlite 被删除、重建或临时不可用时，系统仍可从项目内原始证据重新驱动 intake/replay。",
          "required": true,
          "status": "accepted",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "manual-v139-friction-intake-implement-20260428",
          "verified_by_run_id": "run-20260428T173908043826",
          "accepted_at": "2026-04-28T09:39:24.956923+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1",
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
          "source": "user-story:markdown"
        },
